## 🔍 Syntax Breakdown: How MDXpy Resolves This
By utilizing the parameters above, the engine forces MDXpy to generate distinct multi-dimensional operations:

* filter_by_attribute: Translates into an MDX FILTER clause checking [Account].[Reporting_Group] = "Operating Expenses".
* filter_by_level: Translates into [Product].[ByCategory].AllMembers paired with an .Ordinal = 0 conditional loop to strip out parents.
* from_members: Bypasses full subsets completely to query the precise cell string index location specified.

